25:["$","section","3-Commonwealth Master’s and Shared are not one open window",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Commonwealth Master’s and Shared are not one open window"}],[["$","p","The central Commonwealth Master’s deadline passed on 20 October 2026. Commonwealth Shared has its own announced November opening and December deadline. Check the eligible Shared course and institution rather than carrying a closed nomination application into the other route.",{"children":"The central Commonwealth Master’s deadline passed on 20 October 2026. Commonwealth Shared has its own announced November opening and December deadline. Check the eligible Shared course and institution rather than carrying a closed nomination application into the other route."}],["$","p","The general Commonwealth Master’s scheme does not fund MBA degrees. Business-related course titles need to be read carefully: an MSc and an MBA are different qualifications, and award eligibility follows the actual degree.",{"children":"The general Commonwealth Master’s scheme does not fund MBA degrees. Business-related course titles need to be read carefully: an MSc and an MBA are different qualifications, and award eligibility follows the actual degree."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://cscuk.fcdo.gov.uk/scholarships/commonwealth-masters-scholarships/",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://cscuk.fcdo.gov.uk/scholarships/commonwealth-masters-scholarships/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Commonwealth Master's, including the MBA exclusion"}]]}],["$","span","https://cscuk.fcdo.gov.uk/scholarships/commonwealth-shared-scholarships",{"children":[" · ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://cscuk.fcdo.gov.uk/scholarships/commonwealth-shared-scholarships","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Commonwealth Shared"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}]
26:["$","section","4-Tests and academic evidence: no universal HAT or GRE rule",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Tests and academic evidence: no universal HAT or GRE rule"}],[["$","p","HAT is relevant where the applicable HEC postgraduate call requires it. USEFP’s Fulbright degree application has GRE requirements. Erasmus Mundus and direct university routes set their own evidence. Record validity periods, score reporting and whether the test must be completed by the actual deadline.",{"children":"HAT is relevant where the applicable HEC postgraduate call requires it. USEFP’s Fulbright degree application has GRE requirements. Erasmus Mundus and direct university routes set their own evidence. Record validity periods, score reporting and whether the test must be completed by the actual deadline."}],["$","p","For the degree, confirm the required years/level of education and subject fit under the owner’s instructions. Do not assume that every 16-year qualification or every English-medium letter meets every programme’s requirements.",{"children":"For the degree, confirm the required years/level of education and subject fit under the owner’s instructions. Do not assume that every 16-year qualification or every English-medium letter meets every programme’s requirements."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.hec.gov.pk/english/scholarshipsgrants/lao/pages/default.aspx",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.hec.gov.pk/english/scholarshipsgrants/lao/pages/default.aspx","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"HEC Learning Opportunities Abroad"}]]}],["$","span","https://www.usefp.org/scholarships/fulbright-degree.cfm",{"children":[" · ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.usefp.org/scholarships/fulbright-degree.cfm","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"USEFP degree programme"}]]}],["$","span","https://usefp.org/scholarships/fulbright-degree-FAQ.cfm",{"children":[" · ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://usefp.org/scholarships/fulbright-degree-FAQ.cfm","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"official FAQ"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}]
27:["$","section","5-Check full funding against the costs left to pay",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Check full funding against the costs left to pay"}],[["$","p","Separate tuition, mandatory fees, living allowance, insurance, travel and the payment schedule. A fee waiver cannot pay an airline bill. Reimbursement may still require upfront cash, while dependants and personal costs can remain outside an award.",{"children":"Separate tuition, mandatory fees, living allowance, insurance, travel and the payment schedule. A fee waiver cannot pay an airline bill. Reimbursement may still require upfront cash, while dependants and personal costs can remain outside an award."}],["$","p","Original example: a student’s accepted plan includes a confirmed tuition waiver but no confirmed living award. Their living-cost budget remains fully unfunded until an actual award decision says otherwise. A pending scholarship is a separate scenario, not money already available.",{"children":"Original example: a student’s accepted plan includes a confirmed tuition waiver but no confirmed living award. Their living-cost budget remains fully unfunded until an actual award decision says otherwise. A pending scholarship is a separate scenario, not money already available."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
28:["$","section","6-Build an admission-to-award timeline",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Build an admission-to-award timeline"}],[["$","p","Start with the earliest required stage: nomination, test or course admission can precede the scholarship form. Ask referees with enough time and follow any programme rules about AI or outside writing assistance. Statements must reflect the applicant’s own record and the actual course.",{"children":"Start with the earliest required stage: nomination, test or course admission can precede the scholarship form. Ask referees with enough time and follow any programme rules about AI or outside writing assistance. Statements must reflect the applicant’s own record and the actual course."}]],["$","ol",null,{"className":"process-steps","aria-label":"Build an admission-to-award timeline","children":[["$","li","Shortlist a degree type and academic fit.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":1}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Shortlist a degree type and academic fit."}]]}],["$","li","Check Pakistan/residence eligibility and application route.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":2}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Check Pakistan/residence eligibility and application route."}]]}],["$","li","Record tests, references and both admission/funding dates.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":3}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Record tests, references and both admission/funding dates."}]]}],["$","li","Submit each required application and retain confirmation.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":4}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Submit each required application and retain confirmation."}]]}],["$","li","Read award, renewal, return/service and other conditions before accepting.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":5}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Read award, renewal, return/service and other conditions before accepting."}]]}]]}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Build an admission-to-award timeline","children":[["$","$L4","/scholarships/masters/",{"href":"/scholarships/masters/","children":["Master’s funding directory",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/scholarships/commonwealth/",{"href":"/scholarships/commonwealth/","children":["Commonwealth route guide",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/statement-of-purpose/",{"href":"/guides/statement-of-purpose/","children":["Statement-of-purpose planning",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
29:["$","section","7-Choose the guide for your actual degree",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Choose the guide for your actual degree"}],[["$","p","Use this page for non-MBA postgraduate study abroad. MBA fee caps, work experience and repayable business-school aid need their own comparison. Domestic Pakistani university funding also follows a different institutional process.",{"children":"Use this page for non-MBA postgraduate study abroad. MBA fee caps, work experience and repayable business-school aid need their own comparison. Domestic Pakistani university funding also follows a different institutional process."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Choose the guide for your actual degree","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/mba-scholarships-for-pakistani-students/",{"href":"/guides/mba-scholarships-for-pakistani-students/","children":["MBA scholarships and remaining costs",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/scholarships-in-pakistan/",{"href":"/guides/scholarships-in-pakistan/","children":["Domestic Pakistan aid",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/scholarships-for-pakistani-students/",{"href":"/guides/scholarships-for-pakistani-students/","children":["Pakistan scholarship overview",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
